# Post-implementation checklist

Complete in order after each plan/scope. Skip only when N/A.

1. Plan file in `.cursor/plans/` with correct `NNN_<scope>_<slug>_<id>.plan.md` naming
2. Plan includes `ADR: <pillar> , <ids>` when ADRs apply
3. Build and dev verify per `after-implementation-build-dev.mdc` and `post-implementation-build-dev` skill
4. Tests — add/run when scope requires; fix failures
5. Migrations — run when scope includes schema changes
6. Remove deprecated code marked for removal in scope
7. Handoff brief in `notes/implementations/<plan_base>_brief.txt` on plan close-out
8. Update owner checklist per `owner-checklist-agent-edits.mdc` when high-level goal locked (toggle `[x]`, optional same-line label)

No end-of-session bulk commits. One atomic change = one commit + one `task_graph.log` line.
